#: ../../source/references_examples.md:131
msgid "Common Mistakes to Avoid"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/references_examples.md:133
msgid ""
"**Do NOT use `\"label\"` property** -- this is the #1 mistake. It is NOT "
"part of the Excalidraw file format and will be silently ignored, "
"producing blank shapes with no visible text. Always use container binding"
" (`containerId` + `boundElements`) as shown in the examples above."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/references_examples.md:134
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**Every bound text needs both sides linked** -- the shape needs "
"`boundElements: [{\"id\": \"t_xxx\", \"type\": \"text\"}]` AND the text "
"needs `containerId: \"shape_id\"`. If either is missing, the binding "
"won't work."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/references_examples.md:135
msgid ""
"**Include `originalText` and `autoResize: true`** on all text elements --"
" Excalidraw uses these for proper text reflow."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/references_examples.md:136
msgid ""
"**Include `fontFamily: 1`** on all text elements -- without it, text may "
"not render with the expected hand-drawn font."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/references_examples.md:137
msgid ""
"**Elements overlap when y-coordinates are close** -- always check that "
"text, boxes, and labels don't stack on top of each other"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/references_examples.md:138
msgid ""
"**Arrow labels need space** -- long labels like \"ATP + NADPH\" overflow "
"short arrows. Keep labels short or make arrows wider"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/references_examples.md:139
msgid ""
"**Center titles relative to the diagram** -- estimate total width and "
"center the title text over it"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/references_examples.md:140
msgid ""
"**Draw decorations LAST** -- cute illustrations (sun, stars, icons) "
"should appear at the end of the array so they're drawn on top"
msgstr ""

